## Start with the Shipment API

[Book your first shipment](/docs/guides/first-shipment/) walks through creating and tracking a shipment, with the live API console in the page. Browse every operation in the [Shipment API reference](/apis/shipments), or find the other eight APIs in the [API Catalog](/catalog).
